# Netlify routing for online247now.x
#
# The Netlify site is static. The store API (server/index.js) needs a Node host
# with persistent storage (see DEPLOYMENT.md). Until that host exists, every
# /api request gets a clear JSON 404 and the site shows "store opening soon".
#
# When the Node API is live, replace the /api line below with (one line):
#   /api/*  https://YOUR-NODE-HOST/api/:splat  200
# and set APP_ORIGIN=https://online247now.netlify.app on the Node host.

/api/*  /api-offline.json  404
/*      /index.html        200
